   "he": "תָּנוּ רַבָּנַן: הַמּוֹצִיא שֵׂיעָר כְּדֵי לְגַבֵּל בּוֹ אֶת הַטִּיט. [טִיט] לַעֲשׂוֹת פִּי כוּר שֶׁל צוֹרְפֵי זָהָב.",
   "en": "«The Sages taught: One who carries out hair» is liable in a measure «equivalent» to that which is used «to knead clay with it,» as hair would be mixed with clay to reinforce it. The measure that determines liability for carrying out «clay» is if it is sufficient «to make an opening for» the bellows to be placed in «a gold refiners’ crucible.»"
  }
